        "commit_message": "This is a follow-up to https://github.com/cython/cython/pull/7681\nthat generally moves the fix into the `CythonUtilityCode` class.\n\nSince the directives no longer differ for the same kind of utility code,\nthey can now also be removed from the equality comparison.\n\nSee https://github.com/cython/cython/issues/6981",
